WEBVTT

00:00.300 --> 00:02.292
Meet Ex-Eraser Photo App.

00:02.700 --> 00:05.400
Pick a photo, and the AI finds your ex.

00:05.500 --> 00:07.728
Then it rebuilds what was behind them.

00:09.700 --> 00:11.558
It even works in close-ups.

00:12.200 --> 00:15.308
He's gone, and her face
stays exactly as it was.

00:16.700 --> 00:19.735
Everyone else in the photo
stays just as they were.

00:21.200 --> 00:23.900
Prefer something gentler? Crop or soften.

00:24.100 --> 00:26.003
Then print the ones you want to keep.

00:26.700 --> 00:29.300
Ex-Eraser Photo App. Coming soon.
